  "cons": [
    {
      "text": "BER E2 and oil heating",
      "weight": 3,
      "detail": "373 kWh/m²/yr. A heat pump and insulation retrofit is a rough €40–70k before SEAI grants."
    },
    {
      "text": "Not really walkable",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "1.5 km to the village on a rural road, probably without a footpath. Every errand is a drive."
    },
    {
      "text": "No train in the village",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "Thomastown station is about 15 minutes by car."
    },
    {
      "text": "Emergency department 30+ min",
      "weight": 2,
      "detail": "St Luke's, Kilkenny, or University Hospital Waterford. See the 3 a.m. trip below."
    },
    {
      "text": "Dated fit-out",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Pine kitchen, two jacuzzi baths, a steam cabin in a bedroom, fitted carpets."
    },
    {
      "text": "Village flood history",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Storm Babet flooded Inistioge in Oct 2023 and the school was evacuated. The house sits high; check the access road."
    },
    {
      "text": "Own septic tank",
      "weight": 1,
      "detail": "Mains water, but drainage is its own septic tank: ask its age and certification."
    },
    {
      "text": "Strong secondaries are 25 km away",
